# Payment Design Principle

## Backend Driven Payment

Seluruh proses pembayaran harus bersifat **Backend Driven**.

Frontend **tidak boleh** melakukan hardcode terhadap:

- Daftar metode pembayaran
- Logo bank
- Nomor rekening
- Nomor Virtual Account
- QRIS
- Nominal pembayaran
- Biaya admin
- Denda
- Promo
- Diskon
- Urutan payment
- Badge payment
- Instruksi pembayaran
- Status payment

Backend menjadi **Single Source of Truth (SSOT)**.

---

# 311. Payment Configuration API

Sebelum membuka halaman pembayaran, aplikasi mengambil konfigurasi.

```
GET

/payment/config
```

Contoh Response

```json
{
    "currency":"IDR",
    "currencySymbol":"Rp",
    "decimalDigit":0,
    "minimumPayment":10000,
    "maximumPayment":50000000,
    "paymentExpiredMinute":60,
    "pollingInterval":10,
    "allowPartialPayment":false,
    "allowInstallment":false,
    "allowMultipleInvoice":true
}
```

Frontend hanya membaca konfigurasi.

---

# 312. Payment Method API

Saat user memilih **Bayar Sekarang**

```
GET

/payment-methods?billingId={billingId}
```

Contoh Response

```json
{
    "success":true,
    "data":[
        {
            "id":"QRIS",
            "name":"QRIS",
            "group":"QRIS",
            "type":"QRIS",
            "iconUrl":"",
            "sort":1,
            "isActive":true,
            "badge":"Recommended",
            "adminFee":0,
            "description":"Bayar menggunakan QRIS"
        },
        {
            "id":"VA_BCA",
            "name":"BCA Virtual Account",
            "group":"Virtual Account",
            "type":"VA",
            "iconUrl":"",
            "sort":2,
            "isActive":true,
            "badge":"Popular",
            "adminFee":4000
        }
    ]
}
```

